<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 198,176.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 198,176.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 5 totaled 198,176 bales, up from 197,923 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 254 bales issued, 1,236 bales awaiting review, one cancellation, and 13,500 decertification orders.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
